WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:11.822
Rava: Hi, my name is Rava the Lava.

2
00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:14.595
Careful! Don't touch me.

3
00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:20.608
Rava: See, I am one thousand degrees Celsius. I'm hot!

4
00:00:20.609 --> 00:00:23.911
Rava: This is my friend Java the Lava.

5
00:00:23.912 --> 00:00:25.873
She's hot too.

6
00:00:25.874 --> 00:00:29.778
Java: Hi there! It's nice to meet you.

7
00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.901
Rava: We are not from here.

8
00:00:31.902 --> 00:00:35.364
We come from a very different place.

9
00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:39.160
Java: Hey Rava, let's tell them how we got here.

10
00:00:39.161 --> 00:00:42.075
Rava: That's a great idea!

11
00:00:42.076 --> 00:00:45.462
Today, we came out of a volcano.

12
00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:50.837
Rava: Before that, we were magma, which means melted rock.

13
00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:55.703
Rava: We are from deep in the earth.

14
00:00:55.704 --> 00:00:57.875
Java: Let's go have a look!

15
00:00:57.876 --> 00:01:03.346
Java: When you travel down into the earth, it gets hotter and hotter.

16
00:01:03.347 --> 00:01:09.849
Java: Thirty kilometers down, all the rock is melted.

17
00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:12.840
Rava: Down here used to be our home.

18
00:01:12.841 --> 00:01:15.270
We lived here with the magma.

19
00:01:15.271 --> 00:01:18.147
Rava: Everything is very hot.

20
00:01:18.148 --> 00:01:22.179
Java: When rock turns into magma, it makes gas.

21
00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.384
Java: It becomes very crowded down here.

22
00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:29.294
Java: So the gas pushes us up to the surface.

23
00:01:29.295 --> 00:01:34.647
Java: The gas and the magma try to find cracks in the earth's crust.

24
00:01:34.648 --> 00:01:39.893
Java: We push everywhere until we find a crack.

25
00:01:39.894 --> 00:01:43.503
Rava: Hey guys, I found a crack over here!

26
00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:48.693
Rava: When we find a crack in the crust, we climb up it.

27
00:01:48.694 --> 00:01:54.097
Java: We rise and we rise, pushing through the earth.

28
00:01:54.098 --> 00:01:56.269
Rava: It is hard work.

29
00:01:56.270 --> 00:02:01.090
But soon we are almost at the surface of the earth.

30
00:02:01.091 --> 00:02:07.563
Java: When we get to the top, we all work together and [n3@push through the earth's crust.

31
00:02:07.564 --> 00:02:15.529
Rava: Push! We push so hard that we fly up high into the sky.

32
00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:19.294
Java: Whee! We have made it to the surface.

33
00:02:19.295 --> 00:02:21.849
Rava: It is much cooler here.

34
00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.922
Ah, I like it here.

35
00:02:24.923 --> 00:02:30.928
Java: Up here the gas, the air, and the magma all mix into one.

36
00:02:30.929 --> 00:02:33.392
Java: Together they make lava.

37
00:02:33.393 --> 00:02:36.703
Rava: That is how we got here today.

38
00:02:36.704 --> 00:02:41.700
Rava: Most people do not like lava because we destroy their cities.

39
00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:45.081
Java: But we did not know there was a city here!

40
00:02:45.082 --> 00:02:49.968
Rava: Watch out! Get out of the way! We can't stop.

41
00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:53.339
Java: Now we are beginning to cool down.

42
00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.625
Rava: Soon we will become rock.

43
00:02:55.626 --> 00:02:59.571
Rava: Then, we will be part of a volcanic mountain.

44
00:02:59.572 --> 00:03:04.979
Java: Volcanoes make very large mountains.

45
00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:09.707
Rava: Many mountains were made by lava that cooled into rock.

46
00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:14.118
Java: There are the Smokey Mountains in the eastern United States.

47
00:03:14.119 --> 00:03:16.761
Rava: There is Mount Kenya in Africa.

48
00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:19.779
Java: And many, many more.

49
00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:23.291
Sometimes volcanoes erupt in the ocean.

50
00:03:23.292 --> 00:03:27.189
Java: When this happens, a new island is made.

51
00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:31.355
Rava: The islands of Hawaii were made from a volcano.

52
00:03:31.356 --> 00:03:37.390
Rava: Long ago, magma pushed through the earth's crust under the ocean.

53
00:03:37.391 --> 00:03:42.864
Rava: When the lava cooled, the new islands of Hawaii were born.

54
00:03:42.865 --> 00:03:44.813
Rava: We must say good-bye.

55
00:03:44.814 --> 00:03:46.808
We are becoming hard.

56
00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:49.233
Soon we will be rock.

57
00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:50.455
Java: Good-bye!

58
00:03:50.456 --> 00:03:53.959
Rava: So long!
